    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20061201.0580\n\nLONDON, Dec 1 , 2006, 2006\n\nTests confirm polonium 210 in body of Russia ex-spy's contact\n\n\n\n\nMario Scaramella, an Italian contact of dead former Russian ex-spy Alexander Litvinenko, was admitted to hospital on Friday after tests detected radioactive polonium 210 in his body, a University College Hospital spokesman said.\n\n\"Tests have detected polonium 210 in Mr Scaramella's body but at a considerably lower level than Mr Litvinenko,\" the spokesman added.\n\n\"He is currently well and shows no symptoms of radiation poisoning. He is receiving further tests over the weekend.\"",
